## Design Decisions

| Decision | Rationale |
|----------|-----------|
| UUID[] for allergen_ids (not junction table) | Guest alerts are transient; simpler schema |
| Room number as guest identifier | No auth needed; simple for guests |
| Supabase Postgres Changes for Realtime | No auth system; small scale; zero trigger setup |
| Fetch enriched alert after Realtime event | Realtime payload has raw UUIDs, need allergen names |
| Status: new/acknowledged/dismissed | Minimal workflow; staff sees new -> acknowledges -> dismisses |
| Guest update resets status to 'new' | Ensures staff sees updated allergies |
| Sound toggle in dashboard | Respects browser autoplay + staff preference |
| `/guest` as separate route (not tab) | Guest-facing UI is distinct from staff admin |
